SHEPHERD-VITA DIAG engine patch (devfail1, 2026-10-07): ONLY for "Shepherd Menu Diag" (SHPD00016). vita/shepherd/build.sh with
SHEPHERD_DIAG=1 applies it to a COPY of engine/ in its work dir; the normal builds never see it, so their Shepherd.Engine.dll
stays byte-identical. Adds Diag/BootPhase.cs (phase markers: host buffer + an int-only P/Invoke + engine.log), marks every phase of
Program.Main / Boot.Run / BootGame before it starts, and makes engine.log open+append+close per line.


